{"title":"Career Roadmap · Statistician","role":"Statistician","summary":"A Statistician applies statistical theory, mathematics, probability, data analysis, and modelling to collect, analyze, interpret, and communicate information for decision-making.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Statistics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Statistician applies statistical theory, mathematics, probability, data analysis, and modelling to collect, analyze, interpret, and communicate information for decision-making."},{"type":"p","text":"Statisticians work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government and public policy"},{"text":"Healthcare and clinical research"},{"text":"Finance and banking"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Agriculture"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Sports analytics"},{"text":"Data science"},{"text":"Scientific research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Statistics student, a strong long-term pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Statistics","M.Sc Statistics / Applied Statistics","Statistician / Statistical Analyst","Senior Statistician / Statistical Scientist"]},{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is particularly valuable for advanced statistical and research positions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc Statistics, probability, statistical computing, Python/R, SQL, projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"M.Sc Statistics / Applied Statistics, Statistical Analyst / Junior Statistician"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Statistician / Statistical Scientist / Biostatistician / Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior Statistician, Principal Statistician, Statistical Lead, Analytics 