xt":"Perform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Visualization"},{"text":"Produce a formal statistical report."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Time-Series Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Forecast:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Electricity demand"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Stock/market indicators"},{"text":"Product demand"},{"text":"Compare multiple forecasting methods and evaluate their errors."}]},{"type":"note","label":"Tools","text":"R/Python"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Experimental Design Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a controlled experiment involving multiple factors."},{"type":"p","text":"Perform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Randomization"},{"text":"Factorial design"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Interaction analysis"},{"text":"Effect estimation"},{"text":"Statistical conclusions"},{"text":"This demonstrates genuine statistical thinking rather than simple data analysis."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Survey Sampling & Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a survey and demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sample selection"},{"text":"Stratified sampling"},{"text":"Sample-size calculation"},{"text":"Weighting"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Bias analysis"},{"text":"Statistical inference"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Predictive Statistical Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a model to predict an outcome such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer churn"},{"text":"Disease risk"},{"text":"Loan default"},{"text":"Product demand"},{"text":"Student performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional statistical model vs machine-learning model"},{"type":"p","text":"and explain the difference in interpretability and predictive performance."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"intern