ty to explain statistical findings clearly"},{"text":"A defined specialization for postgraduate study"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Statistics → Statistician, the strongest strategy is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not position yourself only as a data analyst. Build yourself as a statistically rigorous professional who can design studies, select appropriate methods, quantify uncertainty, and turn data into defensible conclusions."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Statistics","M.Sc/M.Stat Statistics","Statistical Analyst/Junior Statistician","Statistician","Senior/Principal Statistician"]},{"type":"p","text":"with R + Python + SQL + statistical modelling + experimental design + machine learning + domain specialization creating a strong future-ready profile."}]}]}